---
layout: base.njk
title: "Wickelkleid Lumière — TARA"
description: "Wickelkleid Lumière — 100% Bio-Baumwolle, zeitloses Design. OEKO-TEX® zertifiziert."
bodyClass: "page-product"
---
{% set product = products[0] %}

  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Start</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/collection/">Lumière Douce</a>
      <span>/</span>
      {{ product.name }}
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Page -->
  <main class="product-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="product-page__layout">

        <!-- Left: Image Gallery -->
        <div class="product-gallery">
          <div class="product-gallery__main">
            <img id="productMainImage" src="{{ product.image }}" alt="{{ product.alt }}">
          </div>
          <div class="product-gallery__thumbs">
            <button class="product-gallery__thumb active" data-src="{{ product.image }}" data-alt="{{ product.alt }}">
              <img src="{{ product.image }}" alt="{{ product.name }} Vorderansicht" loading="lazy">
            </button>
            <button class="product-gallery__thumb" data-src="{{ product.hoverImage }}" data-alt="{{ product.hoverAlt }}">
              <img src="{{ product.hoverImage }}" alt="{{ product.name }} getragen" loading="lazy">
            </button>
            <button class="product-gallery__thumb" data-src="/images/tara/editorial-cotton-detail.webp" data-alt="Stoffdetail aus Bio-Baumwolle">
              <img src="/images/tara/editorial-cotton-detail.webp" alt="Stoffdetail aus Bio-Baumwolle" loading="lazy">
            </button>
            <button class="product-gallery__thumb" data-src="/images/tara/editorial-wrap-dress.webp" data-alt="Wickelkleid Lumiere im Lookbook">
              <img src="/images/tara/editorial-wrap-dress.webp" alt="Wickelkleid Lumiere im Lookbook" loading="lazy">
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Product Info -->
        <div class="product-info">
          <p class="product-info__collection">
            <a href="/collection/">Lumière Douce &mdash; FS 2026</a>
          </p>
          <h1 class="product-info__name">{{ product.name }}</h1>
          <p class="product-info__price">&euro;{{ product.price }},00 <small>{{ site.commerce.taxNotice }} · {{ site.commerce.shippingNotice }}</small></p>

          <!-- Colors -->
          <div class="product-info__colors">
            <p class="product-info__colors-label">Farbe: <strong>Crème</strong></p>
            <div class="product-info__color-options">
              <button class="product-info__color-swatch product-info__color-swatch--creme active" title="Crème" aria-label="Farbe Crème"></button>
              <button class="product-info__color-swatch product-info__color-swatch--rose" title="Rosé" aria-label="Farbe Rosé"></button>
              <button class="product-info__color-swatch product-info__color-swatch--sage" title="Salbei" aria-label="Farbe Salbei"></button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Size -->
          <div class="size-selector">
            <div class="size-selector__header">
              <span class="size-selector__label">Größe (EU)</span>
              <a class="size-selector__guide-link">Größenberatung</a>
            </div>
            <div class="size-selector__options">
              <button class="size-selector__option">34</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option">36</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option active">38</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option">40</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option">42</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option">44</button>
              <button class="size-selector__option disabled" disabled>46</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="product-info__model-ref">Model ist 175 cm und trägt Größe 38</p>

          <!-- Actions -->
          <div class="product-info__actions">
            <div class="qty-selector">
              <button class="qty-btn" data-action="minus" aria-label="Menge verringern">&minus;</button>
              <input class="qty-input" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="10" aria-label="Menge">
              <button class="qty-btn" data-action="plus" aria-label="Menge erhöhen">+</button>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn--primary product-info__add-to-cart" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-name="{{ product.name }}" data-product-price="{{ product.price }}">In den Warenkorb</button>
            <button class="product-info__wishlist-btn" aria-label="Zur Wunschliste">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Payment badges -->
          <div class="product-info__payment-badges" aria-label="Zahlungsarten">
            <span>Bezahlen mit:</span>
            {% for payment in site.payments %}
              <span><strong>{{ payment }}</strong></span>{% if not loop.last %}<span>&bull;</span>{% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </div>

          <!-- Accordion Details -->
          <div class="accordion">
            <!-- Materials & Care -->
            <div class="accordion__item is-open">
              <div class="accordion__header">
                <span>Materialien & Pflege</span>
                <span class="accordion__icon">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion__body">
                <div class="accordion__content">
                  <p><strong>Zusammensetzung:</strong> 100% Bio-Baumwolle (GOTS zertifiziert)</p>
                  <p><strong>Gewicht:</strong> 160 g/m² — leicht und fließend</p>
                  <p><strong>Webung:</strong> Popeline — glatte, matte Oberfläche mit sanftem Fall</p>
                  <p class="accordion__subheading"><strong>Pflegehinweise:</strong></p>
                  <p>Maschinenwäsche bei 30°C &bull; Nicht bleichen &bull; Niedrige Temperatur bügeln &bull; Nicht im Trockner trocknen &bull; An der Luft trocknen</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Fit & Size -->
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <div class="accordion__header">
                <span>Passform & Größe</span>
                <span class="accordion__icon">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion__body">
                <div class="accordion__content">
                  <p><strong>Passform:</strong> Figurbetont an der Taille, fließend über die Hüften. Wickelschnitt mit Bindegürtel.</p>
                  <p><strong>Länge:</strong> Midi (ca. 115 cm in Größe 38)</p>
                  <p><strong>Empfehlung:</strong> Fällt normal aus. Bei Unsicherheit empfehlen wir Ihre gewohnte Größe.</p>
                  <table>
                    <thead>
                      <tr>
                        <th>EU Größe</th>
                        <th>Brust (cm)</th>
                        <th>Taille (cm)</th>
                        <th>Hüfte (cm)</th>
                      </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr><td>34</td><td>80-84</td><td>62-66</td><td>88-92</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>36</td><td>84-88</td><td>66-70</td><td>92-96</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>38</td><td>88-92</td><td>70-74</td><td>96-100</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>40</td><td>92-96</td><td>74-78</td><td>100-104</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>42</td><td>96-100</td><td>78-82</td><td>104-108</td></tr>
                      <tr><td>44</td><td>100-104</td><td>82-86</td><td>108-112</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sustainability -->
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <div class="accordion__header">
                <span>Nachhaltigkeit</span>
                <span class="accordion__icon">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion__body">
                <div class="accordion__content">
                  <p><strong>Hergestellt in:</strong> Portugal — in einer familiengeführten Manufaktur mit fairen Arbeitsbedingungen</p>
                  <p><strong>Baumwolle:</strong> GOTS-zertifizierte Bio-Baumwolle aus der Türkei, angebaut ohne Pestizide und mit 91% weniger Wasserverbrauch</p>
                  <p><strong>Zertifizierungen:</strong> OEKO-TEX® Standard 100 — schadstoffgeprüft und hautfreundlich</p>
                  <p><strong>Verpackung:</strong> FSC-zertifizierter Recyclingkarton, kompostierbare Versandtasche</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Shipping & Returns -->
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <div class="accordion__header">
                <span>Versand & Rückgabe</span>
                <span class="accordion__icon">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion__body">
                <div class="accordion__content">
                  <p><strong>Versand:</strong> Kostenlos ab 75&euro; Bestellwert via DHL (2-4 Werktage innerhalb Deutschlands)</p>
                  <p><strong>Rückgabe:</strong> 30 Tage kostenlose Retoure. Rücksendeetikett liegt der Lieferung bei.</p>
                  <p><strong>Widerrufsrecht:</strong> Sie haben das Recht, binnen 14 Tagen ohne Angabe von Gründen diesen Vertrag zu widerrufen.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
